        <mxCell id="noteKey" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#7F7F7F;" value="&lt;b&gt;Not actors.&lt;/b&gt; Airline operations, air traffic control, the flight crew, the aircraft and airport operations are inside the NAS (D-007; the airline per D-035), so they act within the subject, not on it. The regulator constrains the NAS through requirements (SN-GOV-01, background); it does not use it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Grey:&lt;/b&gt; out of study (SN-MIL-01, D-031). Source: D-035." vertex="1">
